## Forking, Cloning, Pull Requests, Code Reviews and Open-Source Contribution

Practical Project: The Fairy Bake – Multi-Developer Website
Environment: Windows PowerShell / Git Bash / Ubuntu

Learning Objectives: 
By the end of this session, students should be able to:
1. Understand collaborative software development.
2. Understand repository owners and collaborators.
3. Manage repository permissions.
4. Add collaborators to repositories.
5. Understand Fork and Clone.
6. Understand upstream repositories.
